        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "A machine launches a baseball from ground level. The baseball reaches a maximum height of\n27.04 meters above the ground at 1.3 seconds and hits the ground at 2.6 seconds. Which equation\nrepresents the height above ground $h$, in meters, of the baseball $t$ seconds after it is launched?"
